  "textRawHtml": "<p><a href=\"https://www.githubstatus.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.githubstatus.com</a></p>\n<p>Update - We are experiencing high error rates around 20% for web experiences and api traffic. Archive downloads and raw repository content downloads are experiencing an approximate 50% error rate. Investigations are on-going into the root cause, and updates will continue to be provided as we investigate.\nAug 17, 2026 - 14:04 UTC</p>\n",
  "textZhHtml": "<p><a href=\"https://www.githubstatus.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.githubstatus.com</a></p>\n<p>更新 - 我们的 Web 体验和 API 流量的错误率很高，约为 20%。存档下载和原始存储库内容下载的错误率约为 50%。根本原因的调查正在进行中，我们将在调查过程中继续提供最新信息。\n2026 年 8 月 17 日 - 14:04 世界标准时间</p>\n",
